  <para style="h">2 Korinto</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ikete rya kabiri Pawulo yandikiye ab’i Korinto</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Korinto</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Ko</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ikete rya kabiri Pawulo yandikiye ab’i</para>
  <para style="mt1">Korinto</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Jewe Pawulo, intumwa ya Kristo Yesu; yabihawe n’ugushaka kw’Imana, hamwe na mwene Data Timoteyo,</para>
  <para style="po" vid="2CO 1:1">Turabandikiye mwebwe ishengero ry’Imana ry’i Korinto, hamwe n’abera bose bo muri Akaya:<verse eid="2CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Ubuntu n’amahoro biva ku Mana Data wa twese no ku Mwami wacu Yesu Kristo bibe muri mwebwe.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo ashima Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Nihashimwe Imana, Se w’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo, Data w’impuhwe n’ukwirura kwose, <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />we aduha ukwirurwa mu bihe vy’imibabaro kugira ngo natwe twiruze abandi ukwirurwa twahawe n’Imana. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Kuko nk’uko turushirizaho gusangira imibabaro na Kristo, ni na ko tuzorushiriza gusangira ukwirurwa na we. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Kandi nimba turiko turaca mu mibabaro, ni ukugira ngo mwirurwe mwongere muronke agakiza; nimba twiruwe, ni ukugira ngo namwe mwirurwe maze mushobore kwihanganira imibabaro isa n’iyo turiko turacamwo. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Ivyizigiro vyacu ku bwanyu birahamye, kuko turazi ko mufatanya natwe mu mibabaro yacu, kandi ko muzokwiruranwa natwe.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Bene Data, twibaza ko mukwiye kumenya imibabaro twabayemwo muri Aziya. Twaciye mu makuba arengeye ayo twashobora kwihanganira, dutakaza ivyizigiro, gushika aho twibaza ko tutakirokotse. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Mu vy’ukuri, twumva ko twaciriwe urubanza rwo gupfa. Ariko ivyo vyabaye kugira ngo tureke kwizigira inkomezi zacu, ahubwo twizere Imana izura n’abapfuye. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Ni yo yadukijije ayo makuba yari kutwica, kandi ni yo izokwama idutabara. Muri yo ni ho twashize ivyizigiro vyacu kandi twizera ko izokwama idutabara. <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />Kandi namwe muzodushigikira mu masengesho, kugira ngo benshi bashime Imana ku bwacu, ku ngabire y’ubuntu yatugiriye mu kwishura amasengesho ya benshi.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo asivya urugendo rwiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Iki ni co twokwirata: n’uko imitima yacu ibishingira intahe, ko twigenjeje neza mw’isi, no mu migenderanire yo hagati yacu na mwebwe, ko twabanye twiyeza kandi turi mu kuri kuva ku Mana. Muri ivyo vyose, twari turongowe n’ubuntu bw’Imana, atari ubwenge bw’abantu. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Kuko mu makete yacu tubandikira, tubabwira ivyo mushobora gusoma no gutahura gusa. Ariko nizera ko <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />kubera mumaze kudutahura bukebuke, noneho muzodutahura rwose ku buryo mutwirata, nk’uko natwe tuzobirata ku musi Umwami wacu Yesu azogarukirako.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Kuko nari nzi neza ko mudutahura kandi mukatwizera, nari nateguye kubagendera ku buryo muhezagirwe incuro zibiri. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Nari nateguye ubwa mbere guca iwanyu ngiye i Makedoniya, ubwa kabiri nkongera nkahaca ngaruka. Maze namwe mugaca mumfashe mu bikenewe ku rugendo rwanje rwo kuja i Yudaya. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Mbega nkibitegura sinari navyiyumviriyeko? Mbega nabaye nk’ab’isi bavuga “Egome” ariko mu mitima yabo ari “Oya”?<verse eid="2CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Ariko nk’uko Imana ari umwizigirwa, nimumenye ko amajambo yacu atari “Egome” na “Oya.” <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Mu Mwana w’Imana Yesu Kristo, uwo twe na Silasi na Timoteyo twabigishije, ntiharimwo “Egome” na “Oya”, muri we ni “Egome” gusa. <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Kuko amasezerano Imana yatanze yose ni “Egome” muri Kristo Yesu. Kandi muri we ijambo “Amen” tuvuga risigura ngo “Egome” riraduga rigahesha Imana icubahiro. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Imana ni yo iduha gukomerana namwe muri Kristo, kandi ni yo yadusize amavuta, <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />idushirako ikimenyetso c’uko turi abayo, ishira Mpwemu wayo mu mitima yacu nk’ingwati yemeza ko tuzoronka ivyo yadusezeraniye vyose.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Imana ni yo ntanzeko icabona, mu kubarahira ko ivyo ndababwira ari ukuri. Igituma ntagarutse i Korinto, kwari kugira ngo sindabateko ishavu. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Ariko ibi ntibisigura ko tugomba kubaremera tubabwira ngo mushire ukwizera kwanyu mu ngiro. Dushaka gukorera hamwe namwe kugira ngo umunezero wanyu wuzuzwe, kuko ukwizera kwanyu ni kwo kuzotuma mushikama.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Ni co gituma nafashe ingingo yo kudasubira kubagendera kugira ngo sinongere kubazanira umubabaro. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Kuko nimba narabateye umubabaro, none ni ba nde bandi basigaye bo kuntera umunezero atari mwebwe nababaje? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Nabandikiye kurya kugira ngo ninaza sinzobabazwe n’abari kuntera umunezero. Ndizera neza ko iyo nezerewe munezeranwa nanje. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Nabandikiye mfise agahinda n’umubabaro mwinshi bivanze n’amarira, atari kugira ngo ndabatere imibabaro, ariko nipfuza ko mumenya urukundo rwinshi ndabakunda.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muharire ababagirira nabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Nimba hariho uwabateye umubabaro, si jewe yabikoreye, ni mwebwe mwese yabikoreye, canke bamwe muri mwebwe, kandi aha sindengeje urugero. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Abenshi muri mwebwe mwaramugwanije kandi ico gihano yahawe kiramaze. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Ni co gituma ubu hageze ko mumuharira, mukamwirura, ahandi ho umubabaro womuca intege. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Ndabinginga rero ngo musubire mumwereke urukundo. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Ikindi catumye ndabandikira kwari ukubageza ngo ndabe ko mukurikiza ivyo nababwiye vyose. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Uwo muntu mumuhariye, nanje nzoba ndamuhariye. Kandi igihe cose bikenewe ko ntanga imbabazi, ndabikora ku bwanyu ndi imbere ya Kristo, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />kugira ngo Satani ntaronke aho adufatira, kuko tutayobewe urwenge rwiwe.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umwitwarariko n’ukuremeshwa vya Pawulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Igihe naja i Tirowa kuvuga Ubutumwa Bwiza bwa Kristo, nasanze Imana yanyugururiyeyo imiryango. <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Ariko nagumanye umutima uhagaze kuko ntasanzeyo mwene Data Tito. Ni co gituma naciye ndabasezera nkaja i Makedoniya.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Ariko Imana ishimwe, yo yatugize imbohe zayo, ikaguma iturongora ubudasiba mu rugendo rwo kwigina intsinzi ya Yesu, kandi ikaduha gukwiza hose ubumote bwiza bwa Kristo, n’ukuvuga kumumenyekanisha ahantu hose. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Kuko ku Mana turi ubumote bwiza bwa Kristo, buduga kuri Yo, bumotera abariko barakizwa n’abariko barahona. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Ku bariko baja mu mahonero turi umunuko w’urupfu no gutikizwa. Ariko ku bariko barakizwa turi akamoto keza k’ubuzima. Mbega ni nde abereye gukora igikorwa nk’iki? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Twebwe ntituvuga ijambo ry’Imana turondera inyungu nk’uko benshi babigira. Ahubwo muri Kristo tuvuga ukuri kwo mu mitima yacu turi imbere y’Imana, nk’abatumwe na yo.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Mbega ubu dusubiriye gutangura kwimenyekanisha? Canke dukeneye amakete yo kutumenyekanisha mwandikirwa nk’uko biba ku bandi canke bakabasaba ngo muyandike Ku bwabo? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Ni mwebwe nyene makete yacu yanditswe mu mitima yacu, ayo bose basoma bagatahura. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Muragaragaza ko muri ikete ryanditswe na Kristo, ryavuye mu gikorwa cacu, ritanditswe n’irangi ry’ikaramu, ariko ryanditswe na Mpwemu w’Imana nzima, atari ku bisate vy’amabuye ariko ku bisate vy’imitima y’abantu.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Ivyo turabizi neza kubera ukwizigira Imana guhambaye dufise muri Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Ntitwibaza ko dushoboye gukora ikintu na kimwe ku bw’inkomezi zacu, ariko Imana ni yo idushoboza gukora vyose. <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />Ni yo yatugize abakozi b’isezerano rishasha, isezerano ritavuye ku vyagezwe ariko rivuye kuri Mpwemu; kuko ivyagezwe birica ariko Mpwemu atanga ubugingo.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubwiza butangaje bw’isezerano rishasha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Igihe ivyagezwe vyandikwa ku bisate vy’amabuye indome ku yindi, vyandikanywe ubwiza bw’Imana, ku buryo Abisirayeli batashobora kuraba mu maso ha Mose kubera ukwo gukayangana, n’aho kwari ukw’akanya gato, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />mbega igikorwa ca Mpwemu Yera ntikizorushiriza kugira ubwiza burengeje? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Nimba igikorwa catuma dutsindwa cari cisakaye ubwiza nk’ubwo, mbega igikorwa kituzanira ukugororoka ntikizorushiriza kwambara ubwiza buhebuje? <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Mbere twovuga n’uko ubwo bwiza bwa mbere atari n’ubwiza ubugereranije n’ubw’ino nzira nshasha. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Kandi nimba ivyo vya kera bihera vyari vyuzuye ubwiza, mbega ibishasha bizohoraho ntibizorushiriza kugira ubwiza burengeje?<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Ko dufise ivyo vyizigiro, dufise ugushira amanga. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />Ntitumeze nka Mose yahisha mu maso hiwe n’igitambara kugira ngo Abisirayeli ntibabone ukwo gukayangana, kandi kwari ukw’akanya gato. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Ariko ubwenge bwabo bwarimwo umwijima, kuko gushika n’ubu ico gitambara kibagumako iyo basoma ivy’Isezerano rya Kera. Nticigeze kibakurwako, kuko muri Kristo ari ho gikurirwaho. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />No gushika uno musi, iyo basomye ivyanditswe na Mose, ico gitambara kiguma gipfutse imitima yabo, bigatuma badatahura. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Ariko iyo umuntu ahindukiriye Umwami Yesu, ca gitambara gica kimuvako. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Umwami ni we Mpwemu, kandi aho Mpwemu w’Imana ari haba umwidegemvyo. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Natwe abakuweko ico gitambara, tugaragaza ubwiza bw’Umwami wacu, kandi tukaba turiko turahindurwa ngo duse na we, tuva mu bwiza tuja mu bundi, na bwo bukaba buva ku Mwami wacu, na we akaba ari Mpwemu.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ubugororotsi mw’ivugabutumwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />None rero, kubera ko Imana mu buntu bwayo yatwizigije iki gikorwa, imitima yacu nticika intege. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Ariko twahevye ibiterasoni vyose twakora twinyegeje; ntidukoresha ubugunge, ntitugoramika ijambo ry’Imana. Ahubwo tuvugira ukuri ahabona, kugira ngo abantu bamenye abo turi imbere y’Imana. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Kandi nimba Ubutumwa Bwiza tuvuga budatahuritse, ni ku bariko baraja mu mahonero bonyene. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Umwami w’iyi si yarahumishije ubwenge bw’abatizera, kugira ngo ntibabone umuco w’Ubutumwa Bwiza bw’ubwiza bwa Kristo, we shusho y’Imana. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Kuko iyo tuvuga ubutumwa, ntitwivuga twebwe nyene. Ariko twigisha ko Yesu ari Umwami, natwe tukaba abakozi banyu ku bwa Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Imana yavuze iti: “Ahari umwijima nihabe umuco,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 1:3">Itanguriro 1:3</ref></char></char></note> yatumye umuco wayo ukayangana mu mitima yacu kugira ngo turonke ugutahura ivy’ubwiza bw’Imana bukayanganira kuri Yesu Kristo.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Ariko twebwe ubwacu tumeze nk’udukono tumeneka turimwo ubwo butunzi buhebuje. Ni co cerekana ko ubushobozi buhambaye bukorera muri twebwe buva ku Mana, atari kuri twebwe. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Dushikirwa n’ingorane z’ubwoko bwose, ariko turi bazima. Turakehanirwa ariko ntiducika intege. <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />Turahamwa ariko ntituva ku Mana. Dukubitwa hasi ariko ntidupfa. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Mu mibabaro yacu, imibiri yacu isangira urupfu na Yesu kugira ngo ubuzima bwiwe bubonekere mu mibiri yacu. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />N’aho turi bazima, twama duhakwa kwicwa ku bwa Yesu, kugira ngo ubuzima bwiwe bubonekere mu mibiri yacu ipfa. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Ni ukuvuga ko urupfu rukorera muri twebwe, kugira ngo ubugingo bukorere muri mwebwe.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Ariko twamizako tuvuga Ubutumwa Bwiza, kuko turi muri Mpwemu umwe n’umwanditsi wa Zaburi yavuze ati: “Nabanje kwizera, ari na yo mpamvu navuze.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 116:10">Zaburi 116:10</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Turazi ko Imana yazuye Yesu mu bapfuye izotuzurana na we, itwerekane hamwe namwe imbere yiwe. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Imibabaro yose ducamwo ni ku bwanyu, kugira ngo ubuntu bw’Imana buriko burashikira benshi butume amashimwe asesekara, maze Imana ihabwe icubahiro.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Ni co gituma tudacika intege, naho imibiri yacu iriko irashira, umuntu wacu w’imbere aguma yiyubura ku musi ku musi. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Kuko imibabaro yacu naho ari mito kandi y’akanya gato, ituzanira ubwiza bw’akaburarugero kandi buzokwamaho. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />None rero ntiduhanga amaso ku biboneka vy’ab’iki gihe, ariko tuyahanga ku bitaboneka, kuko ibiboneka ari ivy’akanya gato, ariko ibitaboneka bizokwamaho ibihe vyose.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="s1">Twitege imibiri mishasha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Turazi neza ko iri ihema tubamwo ari wo mubiri wacu niwapfa ugakurwa kuri iyi si tuzoronka inyubakwa iva ku Mana, inzu izokwamaho yo mw’ijuru, itubatswe n’amaboko y’abantu. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Ivyo bitarashika, tunihira mu mubiri wacu, turindiriye kwambikwa imibiri yo mw’ijuru nk’ivyambarwa vyacu, <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />kuko tumaze kuyambara ntituzosangwa turi gusa. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Tukiri muri uwu mubiri twambaye, turaboroga, tukaruha, ariko ntibisigura ko twipfuza gupfa ngo tuwuvemwo. Ahubwo ni kubera ko twipfuza kwambara imibiri yacu mishasha, kugira ngo iyi mibiri ipfa ihindurwe iyizobaho ibihe vyose. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Imana ni yo nyene yabiduteguriye, ica iduha na Mpwemu wayo nk’ingwati yemeza ibizoza.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Nuko rero twama twumva turemye, naho tuzi ko tukiri muri iyi mibiri, tuba turi kure y’aho Umwami ari. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Tubayeho mu kwizera, ntitubayeho kubera ivyo tubona. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Twumva turemye nk’uko nabivuze, kandi icotubera ciza ni uko twova muri uwu mubiri, kuko twoca twigira i muhira kwibanira n’Umwami wacu. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Ariko ico twipfuza imbere ya vyose, ni ukunezereza Umwami wacu, haba mu kuguma muri uwu mubiri canke mu kuwuvamwo. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Kuko twese tuzohagarara imbere y’intebe y’imanza ya Kristo, kugira ngo umwe wese ahabwe impera y’ivyo yakoze akiri muri uwu mubiri, biba vyiza canke bibi.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Igikorwa c’umwuzuzo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Nuko rero kuko tuzi ico ari co kwubaha Umwami, dukora ibishoboka ngo twemeze abantu. Ico turi kiragaragarira Imana, kandi nizera ko namwe kibagaragarira mu mitima yanyu. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Ntituriko turondera kwemerwa namwe kandi, ariko dushaka kubaha akaryo ngo mwirate ku bwacu, kugira ngo muronke ico mwishura abishimira ibikorwa bihambaye bigaragarira amaso y’abantu ariko bitari mu mitima yabo. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Nimba tuboneka nk’ibijuju, ni ukugira ngo duheshe Imana icubahiro. Ariko nimba tuboneka nk’abanyabwenge, ni ku neza yanyu. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Kuko urukundo rwa Kristo ruratugobera. Kandi kubera tuzi ko Kristo yapfiriye bose, twese twarapfuye kuri kamere muntu kacu ka kera. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Kandi yapfiriye bose kugira ngo ntihagire uwubaho yinezereza ariko abeho anezereza uwamupfiriye akanamuzukira.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Ni co gituma uhereye ubu ata we tuciyumvirako twisunze ubwenge bw’abantu. Naho kera Kristo twamwiyumvira twisunze ubwenge bw’abantu, ubu si ko bikiri. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Kuko uwuri muri Kristo Yesu aba abaye icaremwe gishasha, ivya kera biba biheze, ibishasha biba bishitse. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Kandi ivyo vyose biva ku Mana yo yaduhaye kwuzura na yo biciye muri Kristo, ica iduha n’igikorwa c’umwuzuzo. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Kuko Imana yiyujuje n’isi muri Kristo itabaharuyeko ivyaha vyabo. Natwe yaduhaye ico gikorwa gihambaye co kuvuga ubutumwa bw’umwuzuzo. <verse eid="2CO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />None rero turi ivyariho vya Kristo, Imana iriko ibingingira muri twebwe. Natwe turabinginga mu gishingo ca Kristo ngo mwuzure n’Imana. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Imana yahinduye icaha uwutigeze acumura, ku neza yacu, kugira ngo muri we ducike ukugororoka kw’Imana.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />None rero ko dukorana n’Imana, turabinginga ngo ntimupfishe ubusa ubuntu bw’Imana. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Kuko Imana ivuga iti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">“Igihe gikwiye kigeze narakwumvise,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">no ku musi wo gukirizwako naragutabaye.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 49:8">Yesaya 49:8</ref></char></char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Ndababwiye ko iki ari co gihe co kwemererwamwo, uwu ni wo musi wo gukirizwako.<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ugutama kwa Pawulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Turirinda kugira ngo ntihagire uwo tubera igitsitaza kuko vyotuma igikorwa cacu kigawa. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Mu vyo dukora vyose, twerekana ko turi abakozi b’Imana b’ukuri mu kwihanganira amarushwa, imibabaro, n’ivyago vy’ubwoko bwose: <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />mu gukubitwa, mu gushirwa mu mabohero, mu gukora ibikorwa vyinshi biruhije, mu kurara maso, mu gusonza. <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />Ivyo dukora vyose tubikorana imitima itanduye, dufise ubwenge, dufise ukwihangana n’ubugwaneza biva kuri Mpwemu Yera, no mu rukundo atari uruheyiheyi. <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />Twigisha ijambo ry’Imana mu bwizigirwa no mu kuri kwaryo, kandi ubushobozi bw’Imana bukorera muri twebwe. Twitwaje ibigwanisho vy’ukugororoka mu kuryo no mu kubamfu. <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />Turakorera Imana abantu batwubaha canke batugaya, badutuka canke badushima. Turi imvugakuri, ariko batwita ababeshi. <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />Dufatwa nk’abatazwi ariko tuzwi na bose. Dusa n’abegereje urupfu ariko tubandanya tubaho. Turakubitwa ariko ntidupfa. <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />Turababazwa mu mitima ariko twamana umunezero. Dufatwa nk’abakenye ariko dutungishije benshi. Tuboneka nk’aho ata co dufise ariko dufise vyose.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Bagenzi b’i Korinto, twababwiranye umutima utagira uburyarya, kandi twabugururiye imitima yacu. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Ntitwananiwe no kubereka urukundo, ariko ni mwebwe mwugaye imitima yanyu. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />None rero ndababwiye nk’abana banje ngo mwakire urukundo rwacu, mutwugururire imitima yanyu.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Twirinde gusenga ibigirwamana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Ntimukifatanye n’abatizera, kuko ubugororotsi n’ubukozi bw’ikibi nta ho bihurira, kandi umuco n’umwijima nta co bisangiye. <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Mbe Kristo na Beliyali hari ico bahurirako? Mbega uwizera n’uwutizera bohurira ku ki? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Mbega urusengero rw’Imana hari ico rwohurirako n’ibigirwamana? Twebwe turi urusengero rw’Imana, kandi Imana yavuze iti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">“Nzoba muri bo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">nongere ngendane na bo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">Nzoba Imana yabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">na bo bazoba abantu banje.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 26:12">Abalewi 26:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:38">Yeremiya 32:38</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:27">Ezekiyeli 37:27</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />None rero,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">“Nimuve muri bo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">mwitandukanye na bo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">ni ko Uhoraho Imana avuze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">Ntihagire igihumanye mukorako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">nanje nzobiyegereza.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 52:11">Yesaya 52:11</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 20:34">Ezekiyeli 20:34</ref>,<ref loc="EZK 20:41">41</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />Kandi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">“Nzobabera So,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">namwe muzombera abahungu n’abakobwa,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Mushoboravyose avuze.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="2SA 7:14">2 Samweli 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:8">7:8</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />None rero bene Data, ko dufise ayo masezerano, nimuze twiyeze, twiyambure ivyonona imitima n’imibiri yacu vyose. Turondere ukwezwa kuvuye ku kwubaha no gutinya Imana.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo anezerererwa ukwihana kw’ishengero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Turabinginze ngo mutwugururire imitima yanyu. Nta we twacumuyeko, kandi nta we twazimije, kandi nta we twarondeyeko inyungu. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Ibi sindiko ndabivuga mu kubacira urubanza. Nababwiye ko muri mu mitima yacu, kandi ko turi kumwe namwe dupfa canke tubaho. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Ndabizeye cane kandi ndabanezererewe cane. Mwaranteye intege cane, kandi mu mibabaro yose naciyemwo, umunezero wanje urasesekaye.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Igihe twashika i Makedoniya, imibiri yacu ntiyigeze ironka agahengwe. Twahuye n’ingorane nyinshi: intambara zari zidukikuje, hamwe n’ubwoba bwari mu mitima yacu. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Ariko Imana itera intege abihebuye yatwiruje ukuza kwa Tito. <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />Twaranezerewe tumubonye tukumva n’ubutumwa buremesha mwamurungikanye. Amaze kumbwira ingene mwipfuza ko nza iwanyu, n’ukuntu mubabajwe n’ivyadushikiye, hamwe n’ishaka mwerekanye mu kunyitaho, umunezero wanje wabaye uw’akaburarugero.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Naho nabateye imibabaro mw’ikete nabarungikiye, sindavyicuza. Naho nari nicujije ubwa mbere kubera nari nabonye ko nabababaje, wari umubabaro w’akanya gato. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Ubu ndanezerewe kubona nararibandikiye, atari kubera vyabababaje, ariko kubera umubabaro vyabateye watumye mwihana mugaheba inzira zanyu mbi. Ni wo mubabaro Imana ishaka ku bantu bayo, ari na co gituma, mu buryo bumwe canke ubundi, atari twebwe twabababaje. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Umubabaro uvuye ku Mana utera ukwihana, ukwihana na kwo gushikana ku gakiza, kandi ntutera ukwicuza. Ariko umubabaro wo muri iyi si ujana mu rupfu. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Nimurabe ico uwo mubabaro uvuye ku Mana wakoze muri mwebwe: wabateye umwete mwinshi, ishaka ryinshi ryo kugaragaza ko ata co mwagirizwa, kubabazwa n’akarenganyo, gutinya, inkumbu, ishaka, umwitwaririko wo kubona icaha gihanwa. Muri ivyo vyose mwarerekanye ko mwejejwe. <verse eid="2CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Intumbero yanje rero ntiyari ukwandika ku bagize nabi canke abagiriwe nabi. Nabandikiye kugira ngo mu nyonga z’Imana umwitwarariko mudufitiye ugaragare. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Ivyo rero vyaraduteye intege.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Kandi icongeye ku kuntu mwaduteye intege, twaranezerewe cane no kubona ingene Tito yari anezerejwe n’ukuntu mwaruhuye umutima wiwe. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Naramubwiye ingene nabanezererewe, kandi ntimwigeze mumaramaza. Ariko nk’uko ivyo twababwiye vyose vyari ivy’ukuri, n’ukubirata kwacu kuri Tito kwari ukw’ukuri. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Kandi iyo yibutse ingene mwese mwamwumvira n’ukuntu mwamwakiranye igitinyiro n’icubahiro cinshi, umutima wiwe urushirizaho kubagirira igishika. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Ndanezerewe cane kuko nshobora kubizera muri vyose.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ugufasha abera b’Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Bene Data, turashaka ko mumenya ubuntu Imana yagiriye amashengero y’i Makedoniya. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Bageragejwe n’ivyago vyinshi kandi bafise ubworo bw’akaburarugero. Ariko bafise umunezero usagutse, wagaragariye mu gutanga kwabo. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Ndabishingira intahe ko batanze uko bashoboye, ndetse n’ibirengeye uko bashoboye. Kandi batanze bavyishakiye bo nyene. <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />Baratwinginze kenshi ngo tubagirire ubuntu ngo bagire ico bakoze mu gutanga imfashanyo igenewe abera b’i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Bakoze ibirengeye ivyo twari twiteze, kanatsinda babanje kwitanga ubwabo, biha Umwami bongera baratwiha nk’uko Imana yabigomvye. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Ni co gituma twinginze Tito, uwabateye intege zo gutanga mu ntango, ngo agaruke abandanye ico gikorwa c’ubuntu akirangize. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Ariko nk’uko muri agakura mu kwizera, mu mvugo, mu bumenyi, mu mwete mwinshi no mu rukundo mudufitiye, mube agakura muri ubwo buntu bwo gutanga.<verse eid="2CO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Ibi sindabibabwira nk’itegeko, ariko nshaka kumenya ko urukundo rwanyu atari uruheyiheyi tugereranije n’umwete ayandi mashengero afise. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Kuko muzi ubuntu bw’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo, ko n’aho yari umutunzi wa vyose, yigize umukene ku bwanyu kugira ngo mu bukene bwiwe mube abatunzi.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Iyi ni yo nama yanje y’uko bikwiye kugenda: mu mwaka uheze mwabaye ab’imbere mu gushaka gutanga, ndetse muba n’ab’imbere mu kubikora. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />None rero nimurangize ico gikorwa mwatanguye, kugira ngo rirya shaka mwerekanye mu ntango ribonekere mu kubishira mu ngiro. Mutange bivanye n’uko mushoboye. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Kuko iyo umuntu atanga n’umutima ubikunze, ico atanze cemerwa n’Imana uko nyene, ntimutegeka gutanga ico adafise.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Ico twipfuza si uko bamwe boroherwa n’ubuzima namwe musigaye mu bukene, ariko ni uko mwogira ibingana. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Ubu mufise umusesekara, kandi murashoboye gufasha abakenye. Ikindi gihe kizoza aho na bo bazoba bafise umusesekara, bakabafasha mukenye. Aho ni ho hazoba hari ukungana. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />Nk’uko Ivyanditswe bivuga: “Abegeranije vyinshi basanze bitarenze ivyo bakeneye, abegeranije bike na bo basanze bitari musi y’ivyo bari bakeneye.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 16:18">Kuvayo 16:18</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tito arungikwa kwakira imfashanyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Ndashima Imana yashize mu mutima wa Tito umwitwarariko nk’uwanje ku bwanyu. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Kuko yakiranye umutima mwiza ugutera intege kwacu, kandi akaba afise inyota yo kugaruka iwanyu avyishakiye. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Tumurungikanye n’uwundi mwene Data ashimwa n’amashengero yose ku bw’ibikorwa vyiwe vy’Ubutumwa Bwiza. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Kandi ishengero ni ryo ryamugenye ngo aduherekeze dutwaye imfashanyo i Yerusalemu, ico ni igikorwa c’ubuntu gihesha Imana icubahiro, kikerekana umwete dufise mu gufasha abatishoboye. <verse eid="2CO 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Dushaka ko ata wodutora utunenge mu buryo dutanga izo mfashanyo. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Kuko twipfuza kubikora neza mu bwizigirwa, atari imbere y’Imana, ariko no mu maso y’abantu.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Tubarungikanye kandi n’uwundi mwene Data twabonyemwo ishaka muri vyinshi. Noneho iryo shaka ryabaye ryinshi ku bw’ivyizigiro afise muri mwebwe. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Nayo Tito we, ni umugenzi dufatanije igikorwa muri mwebwe; abo bandi bene Data na bo, ni intumwa z’amashengero, kandi bubaha Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Nuko rero nimubereke, imbere y’amashengero, icemeza ko urukundo mubafitiye ari urw’ukuri kandi ko dufise imvo ituma tubanezerererwa.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Ntivyari bikwiye ko ndinda kubandikira mwebwe abizera ivyerekeye iki gikorwa co gutanga, <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />kuko ndazi inyota mufise yo gufasha. Namye ndavyirata kw’ishengero ry’i Makedoniya, ndababwira ko kuva mu mwaka uheze mwebwe abo muri Akaya mwari mwamaze kuvyitegurira, kandi ishaka ryanyu ni ryo ryatumye benshi bo mw’ishengero ry’i Makedoniya batangura gutanga. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Ariko ndungitse abo bene Data kugira ngo menye neza ko mwiteguye nk’uko nababwiye, kandi kugira mwegeranye imfashanyo zanyu. Sinshaka ko ivyirato vyanje ku bwanyu vyoba ivy’ubusa. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Kuko hamwe hogira ab’i Makedoniya tuzanana hanyuma bagasanga mutiteguye, twomaramara, ariko mwebwe mwomaramara kurusha kuko mwabivuganye ugushira amanga. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Ni co gituma nabonye ko ari nkenerwa kwinginga bene Data ngo babagendere imbere yuko nza kugira ngo batunganye neza ico gikorwa co gutanga mwiyemeje. Mubitegure nk’igikorwa kivuye mu rukundo, atari ico musunikiwemwo.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gutanga ubikunze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Mwibuke bene Data: ababiba bike bimbura bike, kandi ababiba vyinshi bimbura vyinshi. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Umuntu wese atange ikivuye ku mutima. Ntimupfe gutanga canke ngo mutange kuko mubitegetswe, kuko Imana ikunda uwutangana umunezero. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Imana irashoboye kubuzuza ubuntu bwayo kugira ngo muri vyose na hose muronke ivyo mukeneye, mugire n’ibisagutse bituma mukora igikorwa ciza cose. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Nk’uko Ivyanditswe bibivuga:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">“Batanga n’umutima wagutse mu guha abakene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 9:9">ibikorwa vyabo bizokwama vyibukwa ibihe bidashira.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 112:9">Zaburi 112:9</ref></char></char></note><verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />None rero uwuha imbuto umurimyi akamuha n’ivyokurya, azobuzuriza imbuto mu bigega, yongere agwize umwimbu w’ukugororoka kwanyu. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Muzotungishwa mu buryo bwose kugira ngo muronke ico mutanga aho bizoba bikenewe hose, kandi imfashanyo muduha zizotuma abazironka bahimbaza Imana.<verse eid="2CO 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Ico gikorwa ntikizofasha mu kuronsa abera ivyo bakeneye gusa, ariko kizotuma kandi bahimbaza Imana n’umunezero mwinshi muriko muragikora. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Kubera igikorwa mukora, bazohimbaza Imana kubera ukwumvira kwanyu guherekeza Ubutumwa Bwiza bwa Kristo muvuga, n’umutima w’urukundo mwerekana mu kubafasha no mu gufasha n’abandi na bo. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Kandi bazobasengera n’umutima w’urukundo, kubera ubuntu busesekaye Imana yabagiriye. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Imana ishimwe ku bw’iyi ngabire yayo y’akaburarugero!<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Pawulo yerekana ko ari Intumwa y’Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Jewe Pawulo, ndabinginze n’umutima wiyoroheje no mu bugwaneza buva kuri Kristo, naho mwibaza ko ntari imvuzi imbere yanyu ariko nkabakarira iyo tutari kumwe. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Mbaye ndabinginga hakiri kare kugira ngo ninaza sinzorinde kubakarira nk’uko nzokarira abibaza ko dukurikira inyungu z’abantu. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Naho tuba muri iyi si, ntitugwana nk’ab’iyi si. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Ibigwanisho tugwanisha si nk’ibigwanisho vy’iyi si. Ahubwo dufise ibigwanisho bifise ubushobozi buva ku Mana, bushobora gusambura ibihome bikomeye, ari vyo vyiyumviro bibi n’impari vy’abantu. <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />Dusambura ivyiyumviro bibi vyose vyishize hejuru mu kubuza abantu kumenya Imana, tugafata mpiri ivyiyumviro vy’abagarariji vyose tukabashikana ku kwubaha Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Kandi nimwashika ku kwubaha kwose, tuzohana abo bose bazoba bakiri mu bikorwa vy’ubugarariji.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Nimurabire ku biboneka. Abavuga ko ari Abakristo bategerezwa kumenya ko natwe turi Abakristo co kimwe na bo. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Kuko naho nishimira ububasha Umwami wacu yaduhaye bwo kubakomeza, atari ubwo kubasambura, ntibinteye isoni gukoresha ubwo bubasha. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Sinshaka kuboneka nk’aho ndiko ngerageza kubatera ubwoba mu makete ndabandikira, <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />kuko bamwe muri mwebwe bavuga bati: “Amakete ya Pawulo aragumye kandi arimwo uburake. Ariko iyo ari kumwe natwe aboneka nk’umunyantegenke adakwiye no kwumvirizwa.” <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Abavuga uko bakwiye kumenya ko uko turi muri ayo makete tutari kumwe namwe ari ko tuzoba tumeze mu bikorwa vyacu nitwaba kumwe namwe.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Ntitwubahuka kwiha ibibanza canke ngo twigereranye twebwe ubwacu nk’uko bamwe babigira. Abo bigereranya kuri bo ubwabo ni imburabwenge! Ntidushobora kuvuga ko turi ibitangaza nk’abo bababwira ko bahambaye cane. Bigereranya na bo nyene ubwabo kandi bakigera kuri bo nyene. Ni imburabwenge. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Ariko ntitwishima mu birengeye aho tugeza ububasha. Twishimira ivyabereye mu bikorwa Imana yaduhaye, harimwo ivyo dukorera muri mwebwe. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Ntidushobora kwishimira ibirenze aho, nk’aho twoba tutigeze kubagendera, kuko n’iwanyu twahashitse tuzanye Ubutumwa Bwiza bwa Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Kandi ntidushobora no kwirata ngo turondere kwemerwa ku bw’ibikorwa vyakozwe n’abandi. Ivyizigiro vyacu ni uko ukwizera kwanyu kuzobandanya gukura, igikorwa cacu muri mwebwe kikaguka, <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />kugira ngo dushobore kuvuga Ubutumwa Bwiza mu yandi mahanga. Ni ho tutazokwirata ibikorwa vyakozwe n’abandi mu ntara zabo. <verse eid="2CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />Nk’uko Ivyanditswe bivuga, “Uwirata wese yirate ko yamenye Umwami Yesu,”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="JER 9:24">Yeremiya 9:24</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />kuko uwirata atari we yemerwa, ariko hemerwa uwushimwe n’Umwami.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s1">Abigira intumwa kandi atari zo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Nizera ko muzokwihanganira ubupfu bwanje. Ndabinginze munyihanganire. <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Mfise ipfuhe ryinshi riva ku Mana ku bwanyu. Nabateguye ngo mube umugeni azogira ubukwe n’umugabo umwe gusa, ari we Yesu Kristo, ngo nze ndabashikane imbere yiwe mumeze nk’inkumi itunganye rwose. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Ariko ndatinya ko nk’uko Eva yahenzwe n’ubugunge bw’inzoka, namwe Satani ashobora kuzimiza ubwenge bwanyu akabahubisha mukava muri kwa kwiyegurira Kristo kwuzuye kwanyu. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Kuko iyo hagize uwubigisha Yesu atari umwe twabigisha, canke mukaronka iyindi mpwemu itandukanye n’iyo mwakiriye ubwa mbere, canke mukaronka ubutumwa butandukanye n’ubwo mwemeye ubwa mbere, muravyihanganira.<verse eid="2CO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Nibaza ko abo mwibaza ko ari intumwa zikomeye ata co bansumvya. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Nshobora kuba ntari imvuzi ariko simbuze ubumenyi, kandi ivyo twarabiberetse neza mu buryo bwose. <verse eid="2CO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Mbega nakoze icaha aho nicisha bugufi kugira ngo ndabakuze mu kubabwira Ubutumwa Bwiza bw’Imana ata co ndabasavye? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Meze nk’aho nasahuye ayandi mashengero mu kwemera imfashanyo yayo kugira nshobore kubakorera ata co ndabasavye. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Kandi igihe nari kumwe namwe ngakena, nta we nigeze ndemera, kuko bene Data baje bava i Makedoniya bamfashishije ivyo nari nkeneye vyose. Namye nirinda kuremera umuntu n’umwe mu kintu na kimwe, kandi nzokwama ukwo. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Ndababwije ukuri kwa Kristo aba muri jewe: nta muntu n’umwe wo mu ntara ya Akaya yombuza kwirata ivyo. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Kubera iki mvuze uko? Mbega ni kubera ntabakunda? Haba na mba, n’Imana irabizi.<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Nzobandanya nkora igikorwa canje muri mwebwe kugira ngo nime icitwazo abarondera ivyitwazo vyo kwirata ko bangana natwe mu vyo dukora. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Kuko abo bantu si intumwa z’ukuri, ni ababeshi bigira intumwa za Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Ariko nta gitangaje kuko na Satani yigira umumarayika w’umuco. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Nta gitangaje rero, n’abakozi biwe bashobora kwigira abakozi b’abagororotsi. Ku muhero wa vyose bazoronka impera ihwanye n’ibikorwa bakora.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pawulo yishimira imibabaro yiwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Ndabisubiyemwo, ntihagire uwibaza ko ndi imburabwenge. Ariko nimba mwibaza ko ndi imburabwenge, nimunyumvirize nk’aho mwoba muriko mwumviriza imburabwenge, kugira ngo nanje nirate na gato. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Mu kwirata gutya sindiko mvuga nk’uko Umwami Yesu yovuga, ahubwo mvuze nk’igipfu. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Kandi kubera abandi bafise ivyo birata ivyo bakoze hano kw’isi nanje nogira ico nirata. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Muri vyose mwibaza ko muri incabwenge kandi muryoherwa no kwakira imburabwenge. <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Ndetse mwihanganira n’ababagira abagurano, bakabarenganya bakabanyaga utwanyu, bakishira hejuru, bakabakubita urushi. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Numva mfise isoni zo kubabwira ko umenga twagize intege nke muri mwebwe, kubona tutigenjeje gutyo!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Ariko nimba hari uwufise ico yokwubahuka kwirata, nanje ndagifise, ndabivugishijwe n’ubupfu. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Ni Abaheburayo? Nanje ndi we. Ni Abisirayeli? Nanje ndi we. Ni abana ba Aburahamu? Nanje ndi we. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Mbega ni abakozi ba Kristo? (Nataye ubwenge kubona ndiko mvuga uku.) Ndabaruta. Nakoze cane kubasumvya, nashizwe mw’ibohero kenshi, nakubiswe kenshi katoharurwa, nahatswe gupfa kenshi. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Nakubiswe n’Abayuda incuro zitanu ibimoko mirongo ine ukuyemwo kimwe, <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />nakubiswe inkoni incuro zitatu, rimwe naratewe amabuye, namenekanywe n’ubwato incuro zitatu, namaze umusi n’ijoro mu kiyaga, <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />nagenze ingendo nyinshi kandi ndende. Narahatswe gutwarwa n’inzuzi, narahatswe kugirirwa nabi b’ibisuma, narahatswe kwicwa n’abo mu bwoko bwanje, narahatswe kwicwa n’Abanyamahanga, narahatswe kwicirwa mu bisagara, narahatswe kwicirwa mu misozi, narahatswe gupfira mu kiyaga, narahatswe kwicwa n’abigira bene Data. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Narakoze cane ndaruha, rimwe na rimwe nkarara maso. Narashonje ndanyoterwa, mfata ingendo ntagira imfungurwa, nicwa n’imbeho, ngenda gusa. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Ikirengeye ivyo, namana umwitwarariko ku bw’amashengero yose. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Iyo hagize uwuja mu ntege nke, nanje numva intege nke. Iyo hagize uwusubira mu vyaha numva umubabaro utovugwa.<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Nimba nokwirata, nzokwirata kubw’ibingaragaza nk’umunyantegenke. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Imana Se w’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo, we akwiye gushimwa ibihe vyose, arazi ko mvuga ukuri. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Igihe nari i Damasiko, uwatwarira umwami Areta yategetse ko igisagara ca Damasiko kirindwa kugira ngo mfatwe. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Ariko bene Data banshira mu giseke banyururutsa bancishije mw’idirisha ry’uruzitiro, ndamukira gutyo.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ivyo Pawulo yeretswe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Birabereye ko mbandanya nirata naho ata co bimaze. Ariko ubu reka ndababwire ivyo neretswe kandi namenyeshejwe n’Umwami. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Ndazi umuntu umwe, muri Kristo, yatwawe mw’ijuru rya gatatu, haraciye imyaka cumi n’ine. Sinzi ko yari mu mubiri canke atari mu mubiri, nta vyo nzi, Imana ni yo ibizi. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Koko Imana yonyene ni yo izi ko yari mu mubiri canke yari yawukuwemwo, ariko ndamuzi. <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />Yajanywe mw’iparadizo, yumva amajambo ata muntu yoshobora gusigura, kandi ata muntu yemerewe gusubiramwo. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Nk’uwaciye mu bintu nk’ivyo nari nkwiye kwirata, ariko sinirata inkomezi zanje, nzirata intege nke zanje. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Kandi naho nohitamwo kwirata, sinoba nihenze kuko noba ndiko mvuga ivy’ukuri. Ariko mpisemwo kubireka kugira ngo ntihagire abanyiyumvira ukurengeye uko bambona mu bikorwa vyanje no mu vyo nigisha. <verse eid="2CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Kugira ngo sinishire hejuru ku bw’ivyo neretswe vy’akaburarugero, nashizwemwo ingwara ibabaza kandi idakira mu mubiri, intumwa ya Satani yo kunsubiza hasi kugira ngo noye kwishira hejuru. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Ninginze Umwami Yesu incuro zitatu kugira ngo ayinkuremwo, <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />ariko anyishura ati: <char style="wj">“Ubuntu bwanje buraguhaje, kuko ubushobozi bwanje bukorera muri wewe cane iyo uri mu ntege nke.”</char> Ivyo ni vyo bituma nirata cane intege nke zanje, kugira ngo ubushobozi bwa Kristo bugume kuri jewe. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Ni co gituma, ku bwa Kristo, nezerererwa intege nke, ibitutsi, imiruho, uguhamwa, n’ingorane. Kuko iyo ndi umunyantegenke ari ho mba umunyenkomezi.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umwitwarariko wa Pawulo kw’ishengero ry’i Korinto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Ndiko mvuga nk’imburabwenge, ariko ni mwebwe mwabitumye. Ni mwebwe mwari mukwiye kunshingira intahe kuko naho ata co ndi, sindi inyuma ya bose muri za ntumwa zihambaye. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Igihe nari kumwe nawe, naraberetse vy’ukuri ko ndi intumwa. Kuko mu kwihangana kwinshi nakoze ibimenyetso n’ibitangaza muri mwebwe. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Mbega hari ico ayandi mashengero yaronse mwebwe mutaronse? Hariho kimwe gusa, sinabaremereye ku bijanye n’ivyo kwibeshaho. Nimba mubona ko bitari vyiza, muranyihanganira.<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Ndiko nditegurira kubagendera irya gatatu, kandi na ho nyene sinzobaremera, kuko ico ngomba si ivyo mutunze, ngomba mwebwe nyene. Kuko mu bisanzwe abana si bo bari bakwiye kugaburira abavyeyi, ahubwo abavyeyi ni bo bagaburira abana babo. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />None rero nzobaha ivyo mfise nongere ndabihe nanje ubwanje n’umunezero mwinshi. Ninabakunda rwose, mbega muzoca munkunda buhoro? <verse eid="2CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Namwe muremera ko ntababereye umutwaro. Ariko bamwe muri mwebwe bibaza ko ndi umunyabwenge, ko nabakuyeko inyungu mu bwenge. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Mbega abantu nabatumyeko hari inyungu babatse? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Ninginze Tito ngo aze iwanyu, azanana n’umwe mwene Data wundi. Mbega hari inyungu babakuyeko? Mbega ntitwakoreye mu Mpwemu imwe no mu buryo bumwe?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Mbega mwibaza ko ibi tubivuga mu kubisigurako? Twamye tuvugira imbere y’Imana nk’abari muri Kristo Yesu. Kandi ivyo dukora vyose ga bakundwa, ni ukugira mukomere mu kwizera. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Kuko ndatinya ko noza nkabasanga uko ntipfuza ko muba, canke mugasanga ntameze uko mushaka ko mba. Ndatinya ko hoba hakiri imitongano, inzigo, ishari ryinshi, ukwikunda, ugutukana, urusaku, ukwishira hejuru n’ukubura urutonde mu buzima. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Ndatinya kandi ko aho nzozira Imana izoncisha bugufi imbere yanyu, nkababazwa cane n’uko bamwe muri mwebwe batahevye ivyaha vyabo bakora kuva kera. Ntibihanye ivyonona, ubusambanyi, n’ibindi vy’isoni nke bakora.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Izindi mpanuro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Rizoba ari irya gatatu ndabagendeye. Nk’uko Ivyanditswe bibivuga, “Urubanza rwose ruzocibwe habanje kwumvirizwa ivyabona bibiri canke bitatu.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Gusubiramwo 19:15</ref></char></char></note> <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Naraburiye abagumye mu vyaha igihe nabagendera ubwa kabiri. N’ubu ndabibasubiriyemwo n’aho tutari kumwe: ninagaruka, sinzokwihanganira umuntu n’umwe, <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />ko muriko murasaba ivyemeza ko Kristo avugira muri jewe. Ntananiwe no kubakiza, kuko akorana inkomezi muri mwebwe. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Naho yabambwe ari umunyantegenke, ubu abayeho mu bushobozi bw’Imana. Natwe ni nk’uko, turi abanyantegenke nk’uko Kristo yari, ariko ubushobozi bw’Imana buba muri twebwe iyo turiko turabakorera.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Mwisuzume kugira ngo mumenye ko muhagaze mu kwizera. Nimube ari mwebwe mwisuzuma. Musanzwe muzi ko Yesu Kristo ari muri mwebwe: atari uko, muzoba mwananiwe no kwisuzuma. <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Kandi ndizera ko muzotahura ko tutananiwe no kwisuzuma nk’intumwa. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Ico tubasengera ku Mana ni uko ata kibi mwokora. Atari ukugira ngo abantu babone ko twahagaze neza mu kwisuzuma kwacu, ariko kugira ngo mukore ibibereye naho vyoba bisa nk’aho twananiwe mu gikorwa cacu. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Kuko ata co twemerewe gukora kinyuranye n’ukuri, ariko dutegerezwa guhagararira ukuri. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Turanezerwa iyo tuboneka nk’abanyantegenke ariko mukaboneka ko muri abanyenkomezi. Kandi turabasengera ngo mutunganywe rwose. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Ni co gituma ndabandikira ibi tutari kumwe, kugira ngo ninaza sinze ndabakarire mu bubasha nahawe n’Umwami, kuko ari ububasha bwo kubakomeza atari ubwo kubasambura.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Intasho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Bene Data, ndangije ndabasezera. Murondere ugutunganywa, muterane intege, muhuze umutima n’inama, mubane amahoro, maze Imana y’amahoro n’urukundo izobana namwe.<verse eid="2CO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Muramukanye mu kugumbirana kwera.<verse eid="2CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Abera b’Imana ba hano na bo barabatasha.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14" />Ubuntu bw’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo, urukundo rw’Imana n’ukunywana na Mpwemu Yera bibane namwe mwese.<verse eid="2CO 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>